OL,4,G0406FUnexpected Elements
OL,5,     GThis Boxing Day and holiday
OL,6,     Gseason, our present to you is the
OL,7,     Gscience of gifts, such as
OL,8,     Gdonating blood, sharing food, and
OL,9,     Gthe physics of making hand-
OL,10,     Gknitted gifts.
